message: If you use these materials, please cite them as below.
type: dataset
title: 'Class Participation Scoring — Transcript to Draft Score'
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU
url: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU/tree/main/mlu/ml-ai-applications/mlu-000003-participation-scoring
abstract: >-
  Point this notebook at a Zoom transcript of one class meeting and the material you
  covered that day. It identifies who spoke, judges what they talked about against your
  embedded lesson rather than the model's own knowledge, and drafts a 0–4 participation
  score per student with the evidence behind it. The output is a draft a human reviews,
  never a grade the tool assigns on its own.
authors:
  - name: 'Tariq Hook'
    affiliation: 'Delaware State University'
